<title>POLAND: JELFA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>JELFA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.71 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.58 vs   1.52</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.64 vs   1.51</p>
<p> Sales		   11.83 vs   9.31</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    14.25 vs  11.68</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	20.63 vs  17.41</p>
<p> Operating profit    19.26 vs  17.63</p>
<p> Sales		   97.91 vs  84.45</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Jelfa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
